tOrder":41,"navVisible":22,"layout":23,"cardType":80,"columns":18,"pageSize":25,"itemFields":81,"contentSource":27,"aggregatePages":82,"latestLimit":25,"showCover":30,"coverImage":43,"isHome":30,"tagFilter":30,"showChildDetail":22,"content":13,"reserved":30,"datePosition":44,"aspectRatio":13},"category\u002Flog","中二日志","editorial",{"title":22,"excerpt":22,"date":22,"cover":22},[],{"id":84,"slug":85,"title":86,"parentId":53,"sortOrder":21,"navVisible":30,"layout":23,"cardType":24,"columns":41,"pageSize":25,"itemFields":87,"contentSource":27,"aggregatePages":88,"latestLimit":25,"showCover":30,"coverImage":43,"isHome":30,"tagFilter":30,"showChildDetail":22,"content":13,"reserved":30,"datePosition":44,"aspectRatio":89},24,"category\u002Ffriendshiplinks","友情链接",{"cover":22,"title":22,"excerpt":22,"date":30,"categoryPill":30},[],"1:1",{"id":91,"slug":92,"title":93,"parentId":53,"sortOrder":18,"navVisible":30,"layout":94,"cardType":37,"columns":18,"pageSize":25,"itemFields":95,"contentSource":27,"aggregatePages":96,"latestLimit":25,"showCover":30,"coverImage":43,"isHome":30,"tagFilter":30,"showChildDetail":22,"content":97,"reserved":30,"datePosition":44,"aspectRatio":13},25,"category\u002Fgod","GarfielGod","static",{"cover":22,"title":22,"excerpt":22,"date":22,"categoryPill":22},[],"我真的是人类吗。。。",{"post":99},{"id":100,"slug":101,"title":102,"date":103,"modified":104,"link":105,"content":106,"excerpt":107,"featured":108,"pages":109,"tags":114,"status":115,"format":116,"contentWidth":13,"postStyle":13,"postStyleOptions":117,"allowComments":22,"html":106},749,"from-final-fantasy-7-rebirth","From Final Fantasy 7 Rebirth","2025-05-21T07:56:00.000Z","2026-09-29T08:55:18.515Z","https:\u002F\u002Fgarfieldgod.cn\u002Findex.php\u002F749\u002F","\n\u003Ch1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Cbr>\u003Cstrong>FFF7R\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fh1>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Cstrong>DownLoad\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">GitHub: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FFFF7R\">https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FFFF7R\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gitee: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r\">https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#introduction\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Cstrong>Introduction\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Algorithmic programs replicate the card game mechanics [ From Final Fantasy 7 Rebirth ].\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#attention\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Cstrong>Attention\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u003Cs>The latest update mostly appears in the UnityProject branch.\u003C\u002Fs>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In order to better decouple the logical code from the Unity-specific code, the update of the Unity project has been temporarily suspended.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u003Cstrong>Now, the game and test cases can be executed in the console without relying on Unity.\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#test-case\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Cstrong>Test Case\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#example\">\u003C\u002Fa>Example\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For example, refer to&nbsp;\u003Ccode>Native\u002FConsole\u002FTestCases\u002FTestCase1.cs\u003C\u002Fcode>&nbsp;for more information.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#add-new-test-cases\">\u003C\u002Fa>Add new test cases\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To add a new test case, you need to create a new class under&nbsp;\u003Ccode>Native\u002FConsole\u002FEntry\u002FTestCase\u003C\u002Fcode>&nbsp;and inherit it from&nbsp;\u003Ccode>TestCase\u003C\u002Fcode>, for example,&nbsp;\u003Ccode>NewTestCase : TestCase\u003C\u002Fcode>.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Col class=\"wp-block-list\">\n\u003Cli>Override the \u003Ccode>ChessPad InitChessPad()\u003C\u002Fcode> method to initialize the chessboard.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\n\n\n\u003Cli>Override the \u003Ccode>void InitSteps()\u003C\u002Fcode> method to add the steps for the test case.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Fol>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#init-the-chessboard\">\u003C\u002Fa>Init the chessboard\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">init the test chessboard at the start of the game by override the&nbsp;\u003Ccode>ChessPad InitChessPad()\u003C\u002Fcode>&nbsp;method.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#add-test-steps\">\u003C\u002Fa>Add test steps\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u003Ccode>AddStep(InputerType inputerType, int index, string cardCode, List&lt;List&lt;int&gt;&gt; expectPad1, List&lt;List&lt;int&gt;&gt; expectPad2)\u003C\u002Fcode>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You should use the&nbsp;\u003Ccode>AddStep\u003C\u002Fcode>&nbsp;method inside the&nbsp;\u003Ccode>void InitSteps()\u003C\u002Fcode>&nbsp;method to define the steps for your test case.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#parameters-explanation\">\u003C\u002Fa>Parameters Explanation:\u003C\u002Fh4>\n\n\n\n\u003Cul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>inputerType\u003C\u002Fcode>: Indicates who performed the input on the chessboard. It can be either \u003Ccode>InputerType.PLAYER\u003C\u002Fcode> or \u003Ccode>InputerType.RIVAL\u003C\u002Fcode>.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\n\n\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>index\u003C\u002Fcode>: Specifies which grid on the chessboard you want to input to. The range is based on the size of the chessboard.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\n\n\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>cardCode\u003C\u002Fcode>: Specifies which card you want to input. For more information, see \u003Ccode>Json\u002FChessProperties.json\u003C\u002Fcode>.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\n\n\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>expectPad1\u003C\u002Fcode>: Represents the expected grid levels on the chessboard. It should have the same meaning as the corresponding effects in FF7Rb.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\n\n\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>expectPad2\u003C\u002Fcode>: Represents the expected card levels on the chessboard. It should have the same meaning as the corresponding effects in FF7Rb.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Ful>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#run\">\u003C\u002Fa>Run\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Create an instance of your test case class and call the&nbsp;\u003Ccode>Run()\u003C\u002Fcode>&nbsp;method to execute the test steps you have added, in&nbsp;\u003Ccode>Native\u002FConsole\u002FEntry\u002FMain.cs\u003C\u002Fcode>.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#notes\">\u003C\u002Fa>Notes\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\n\n\u003Cul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n\u003Cli>Ensure that the \u003Ccode>cardCode\u003C\u002Fcode> matches one of the valid codes defined in \u003Ccode>Json\u002FChessProperties.json\u003C\u002Fcode>.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\n\n\n\u003Cli>Ensure that your input is valid. Note that if the \u003Ccode>InputerType\u003C\u002Fcode> is \u003Ccode>RIVAL\u003C\u002Fcode>, the \u003Ccode>GridEffect\u003C\u002Fcode> and \u003Ccode>CardEffect\u003C\u002Fcode> caused by the input will be reversed.\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Ful>\n\n\n\n\u003Ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fgitee.com\u002Fgarfieldgod\u002Ffff7-r#console-game\">\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Cstrong>Console Game\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It is not recommended to run the console game, as it is currently not being maintained.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\n\n\u003Cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Try it from&nbsp;\u003Ccode>Native\u002FConsole\u002FEntry\u002FMain.cs\u003C\u002Fcode>&nbsp;using the&nbsp;\u003Ccode>StartConsoleGame()\u003C\u002Fcode>&nbsp;method.\u003C\u002Fp>\n","\u003Cp>FFF7R DownLoad GitHub: https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002FGarfieldGod\u002FF [&hellip;]\u003C\u002Fp>","\u002Fuploads\u002Fposts\u002F749\u002F750-1747813994-20250521-155245.jpg",[110,112],{"id":18,"title":20,"slug":19,"path":111,"isHome":22},"\u002Fhome",{"id":41,"title":61,"slug":60,"path":113,"isHome":30},"\u002Fcategory\u002Fproject",[],"published","html",{"tocSide":118,"tocProgress":22,"heroImage":13,"heroSize":37,"miniNav":22,"sectionNumbers":22,"linkUrl":13,"linkDelay":34},"right",{"post":100,"views":41},{"comments":121},[],1791302427189]